{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26716","headline":"赠张质山人 · 姚合","name":"赠张质山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生居处僻，荆棘与墙齐。\n酒好宁论价，诗狂不着题。\n烧成度世药，踏尽上山梯。\n嬾听闲人语，争如谷鸟啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《瀛奎律髓》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/瀛奎律髓_(四庫全書本)）"}